    text: "Affected stops:\r\nW 50th Ave & Federal Blvd (#11333) (eastbound)\r\nW 50th Ave & Elm Ct (#11331) (eastbound)\r\nW 50th Ave & Clay St (#11329) (eastbound)\r\nW 50th Ave & Beach Ct (#11326) (eastbound)\r\nZuni St & W 50th Ave (#34345) (eastbound)\r\nZuni St & W 47th Ave (#34347) (eastbound)\r\nZuni St & W Elk Pl (#34348) (westbound)\r\nW 50th Ave & Zuni St (#34346) (westbound)\r\nW 50th Ave & Beach Ct (#11327) (westbound)\r\nW 50th Ave & Clay St (#11328) (westbound)\r\nW 50th Ave & Elm Ct (#11330) (westbound)\r\nW 50th Ave & Federal Blvd (#11332) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 52 get on/off buses at:\r\nW 46th Ave & Zuni St (#34349)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 52 get on/off buses at:\r\nW 46th Ave & Zuni St (#34350)"
